<view class="page-shell cat-page">
  <view class="topbar secondary-topbar" style="{{nav.topbarStyle}}">
    <button class="icon-button icon-button--back" bindtap="goBack" aria-label="返回">
      <view class="back-arrow"></view>
    </button>
    <text class="topbar-label">咨询师</text>
  </view>

  <scroll-view class="cat-scroll" scroll-y>
    <view class="cat-body">
      <text class="cat-title">选择你此刻最需要的陪伴方式</text>
      <text class="cat-sub">三个方向，都可以从一句话开始。选中后进入夜喵对话。</text>

      <view class="counselor-list">
        <button
          class="counselor-card {{item.id === selectedId ? 'is-active' : ''}}"
          wx:for="{{counselors}}"
          wx:key="id"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          bindtap="choose"
          hover-class="is-pressed"
        >
          <image class="counselor-avatar" src="{{item.avatar}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
          <view class="counselor-copy">
            <text class="counselor-name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="counselor-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
            <view class="counselor-tags">
              <text class="counselor-tag" wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:for-item="tag" wx:key="*this">{{tag}}</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <image class="counselor-go" src="/assets/agent/icons/chevron-right-muted.png" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        </button>
      </view>

      <text class="cat-note">当前三位咨询师都使用本地引导脚本回复，没有接入真实的 AI 或人工服务。</text>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
